# Commands run by the launchd job com.redwood.demo (see com.redwood.demo.plist).
# The phone's own radio (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.net2, image built with WIFID=1, boot-arg
# connsys_step=17): the kernel joins the network of fw/network at about 22 s; this waits for it,
# then asks the interface as the kernel has it, configures it by DHCP through configd, resolves
# a name, connects a socket, and fetches a page both over plain TCP and through CFNetwork.
# (rc.jobs.net is the same test on QEMU's en0, which is there from the start.)
/redwood/bin/net_test wait 35 show dhcp en0 waitaddr en0 40 store
/redwood/bin/net_test resolve example.com tcp example.com 80 reach example.com
/redwood/bin/net_test fetch http://example.com/